A '''Gemzie''' is an {{Epic}} [[Critter]] that can be found in the {{Gold|Cavern}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

== Spawning ==
{{Green|3}} '''Gemzies''' spawn in the {{Gold|Cavern}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}} after placing a {{Item|Purple Gem}}, {{Item|Lime Gem}}, and {{Item|Orange Gem}} on their respective podiums. 

== Behavior ==
'''Gemzies''' fly around their spawning location. If a {{Item|Critter Capsule}} is thrown at a '''Gemzie''' and is caught, it dies and drops its loot.

